WEBVTT

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:21.230
The four phenomenal warriors,
representing the four galaxies,

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:25.610
will be special participants in this,
the Tenkaichi Grand Tournament,

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.940
being hosted by world-class multimillionaire
Gyosan Money, have just arrived on Earth!

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:33.070
Oh, my! Things have already
become more exciting!

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.950
This is the first time
I've ever seen an alien,

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:38.410
and I am quite impressed!

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.210
And so, let us ask some questions of Mr.
Gyosan Money.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:46.040
What is the Tenkaichi Grand
Tournament, exactly?

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:50.550
My adorable, only son, Doll,
badgered me for this, you see...

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:54.050
It is our present to him
on his tenth birthday.

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:57.140
Papa, are there really
going to be aliens?

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:58.640
Oh, of course.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.720
This will be a raw battle between the
most powerful Earthlings and aliens.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:05.060
Papa is going to let you watch
it from these special seats.

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:09.730
Doll, as long as you have money in
this world, you can do anything!

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:13.400
P- Producer, could we
ask you to elaborate?

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:19.410
The richest man in the world here, Mr.
Gyosan Money,

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:23.080
is sponsoring the biggest
martial arts tournament ever!

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.620
It's a tournament where,

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.710
regardless of age, gender,
nationality, pro or amateur status,

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:30.060
the most powerful combat sportsmen in
the whole wide world have been invited,

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.710
and they can battle with each
other as hard as they want!

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:35.720
The winner will receive
one hundred million zeni!

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.960
Runner-up prizes of tour
packages for the entire family

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:41.720
to the hot springs resorts of the
world will also be presented!

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:45.640
What's more, the winner
will meet that hero

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:48.060
that saved humanity from the
terror of the Cell Games,

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:53.610
something that my enormous wealth has
made possible for the first time...

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:59.700
The right to challenge
Mister Satan in the ring!

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:18.720
It's the ultra-gifted, most
powerful combat sportsman on earth,

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.140
Mister Satan!

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:43.330
So Mister Satan has become the
one who defeated Cell, huh?

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:46.790
That's okay, I guess.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:04.890
Break through the shining
clouds, and fly away (fly <i>away)</i>

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:12.230
<i>As a panorama spreads
itself throughout my being!</i>

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:17.320
<i>The earth, having been kicked in
the face, gets angry (angry)!</i>

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:24.200
<i>And makes one of its
volcanoes explode!</i>

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:30.620
<i>If, within the thawed polar ice,</i>

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:38.710
<i>There</i> is a dinosaur, then <i>I</i> want to
train him to balance atop a ball.

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:43.220
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA.</i>

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:51.300
No matter what may happen, <i>I</i> feel
as though nothing can bother me,

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.690
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA.</i>

00:03:55.770 --> 00:04:01.740
<i>However hard your chest pounds,
the Genki Dama will roar!</i>

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.240
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA.</i>

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:13.320
<i>The emptier your head is, the more
room there is to pack with dreams,</i>

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.710
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA.</i>

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:24.550
With a cheerful face and an Ultra-Z,
today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai...

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.760
Sparking!

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:18.120
There are exactly 200 contestants
here from all over the world,

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:21.400
confident enough in their abilities to
gather at the Tenkaichi Grand Tournament.

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:24.240
With the chance to challenge the
hero Mister Satan on the line,

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.410
the preliminaries are
already being held

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.570
across eight different
battle stages at once!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:33.580
Each stage has 25 contestants fighting
it out in a Battle Royale format,

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:38.540
and only the last remaining fighter from
each will advance to the semifinals!

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.210
As for an explanation
to the rules,

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:43.210
contestants who fall from the
battle stage into the sea below,

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.880
get knocked out, or give
up, are eliminated.

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:50.640
However, one cannot, of course,
kill another opponent.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:53.850
Also, the use of weapons is
grounds for disqualification.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.910
I wonder who I should
take with me on my tour

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.460
of the hot springs of the world.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:17.870
Gohan-chan!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:21.420
Gohan-chan, stick it to them!

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:27.470
Huh? Gohan has entered?
But he's a Super Saiyan!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:34.560
N- not Piccolo, too!

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:38.350
I don't suppose Trunks
is here as well, is he?

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:50.450
If it was just Yamucha and Tenshinhan,
I figured this could have turned out.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.460
Chichi-san, I'm surprised
you let Gohan-kun enter.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.630
Gohan-chan does nothin' but
study day in and day out.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:06.300
If he doesn't keep his strength
up, it'll be all for nothin'.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.430
I was thinkin' it wouldn't be so bad
to let him relax once in a while.

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:12.050
Is that right? That's
parental love for you.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.510
I wanted to take a tour of
the world's hot springs

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.080
together with the
rest of the family,

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:18.730
and here Trunks had just
come back from the future

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:22.440
to report that he had defeated No.
17 and No. 18,

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:25.570
so this is a golden
opportunity for us!

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.570
What's Vegeta doin'?

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:31.990
That man is useless! It's almost as
if he's lost the desire to fight,

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.950
and he spends his days
just thinking about stuff.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.790
That's because of Goku-sa dyin'.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.920
Ten-san, go get them!

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:47.420
You too, Kuririn, as
long as we're at it.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:51.010
Oolong, there aren't any
pichi-pichi gals around!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:54.800
Gramps, what are you looking at?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.970
We came to watch a martial
arts tournament, right?

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:01.560
We don't need to watch to know that Gohan
or Trunks is obviously going to win, do we?

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:05.730
That's why I'm on the lookout for
gals with D-cups and T-back thongs!

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.780
There they are!

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.410
"Bounce" "Jiggle."

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:25.540
This is even more incredible
than the Tenkaichi Tournament!

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.420
You wish you could enter, huh?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.720
But you're a dead man now.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:36.100
A fight between Gohan and
Trunks is sure to be awesome!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:50.030
I never would have thought that
Gohan and those guys would enter.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:53.450
And here I borrowed money
to take a plane here.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.910
I was going to earn a
hundred million zeni, too.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:59.160
It looks like Yamucha-san doesn't
feel like fighting at all.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:00.580
There's no helping him, huh?

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.580
He's given up on
winnin', after all.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.540
That's right. He
can't beat Trunks.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.670
Or Gohan-chan, either!

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.230
Disqualified!

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.610
Over already?

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.160
Along time ago,

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:42.490
Father also entered the Tenkaichi
Tournament and worked on his skills,

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.080
so that goes for me, too!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.960
Contestant Son Gohan has
passed the preliminaries!

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:57.180
Contestant Trunks has
passed the preliminaries!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.300
How come?

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.570
Contestant Kuririn has
passed the preliminaries!

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.830
Contestant Piccolo has
passed the preliminaries!

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:32.880
Contestant Tenshinhan has
passed the preliminaries!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.090
What?!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:42.760
Contestant Dosukoi, Contestant Udo,
and Contestant Kung Foon have passed!

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:49.810
Mister Satan,

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.140
having seen the preliminaries,
what are your impressions?

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:58.030
N- none of them have
had enough training...

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.700
The semifinals will consist
of the eight contestants

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.700
who passed through the preliminaries
fighting one-on-one against each other.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.200
With Piccolo as my opponent,
luck is not on my side.

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:09.620
Geez, this is the worst!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.880
The first match of the
semifinals will be a fight

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.200
between Contestant Son
Gohan and Contestant Udo.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:23.550
What is this, a kid as my opponent?
This isn't my day.

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:24.720
Hey. Kid!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.850
I'm not holding back on you, just
because you're little, got it?

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.230
Right, understood!

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.230
What? Jerk me around, will you?

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.940
Why, you...

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:42.700
Attaboy, Gohan-chan!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.290
The second match of the
semifinals will be a fight

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:51.860
between Contestant Trunks
and Contestant Tenshinhan.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:58.170
Trunks! I'm not letting
you go easy on me!

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:00.050
Right!

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:14.230
T- they're floating in mid-air!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:16.820
It looks that way to me, too!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.860
<i>Kiko-hol!</i>

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:58.820
M- Mister Satan,
how can this be?

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:00.400
Hmph! I-it's all tricks!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:03.200
Like the quick costume changes in a
Kabuki play! Something like that!

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:09.790
W- what are those guys doing at
a dinky tournament like this?

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.120
Sheesh, how worthless!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:32.390
Contestant Trunks wins!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.910
<i>I-I have to do something!</i>

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:53.450
My, Mister Satan,
you're looking pale.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:57.290
M- my stomach hurts!
Yow-ow-ow-ow!

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:02.210
This won't do! Producer, take
Mister Satan to the dispensary.

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:05.760
L- I'll go by myself.
I-I'll be right back...

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:07.800
Yow-ow-ow-ow!

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.810
I'd better just go on and scram.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:18.770
They say that only fools rush in where
angels fear to tread, after all...

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:21.770
Oh, it's Mister Satan!

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:28.950
Satan! Satan!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:37.910
<i>T- this is no time for
me to be doing this!</i>

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.050
The third match
of the semifinals

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.560
will be between Contestant
Kuririn and Contestant Piccolo.

00:14:55.970 --> 00:15:00.900
<i>Piccolo wouldn't use his
Makankosappo blast on me, would he?</i>

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:07.030
Piccolo-san! Good luck!
Piccolo-san!

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:11.910
Gohan doesn't need to
be cheering Piccolo on.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.910
After all, there's no
way Kuririn can win.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:16.540
Dammit!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.960
<i>If this is how it's going to be,
then I'm going to go out big!</i>

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:30.930
What's with that
indifferent stance?!

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:36.010
He's doing that to make a fool of me!
He's definitely making a fool of me!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.020
Piccolo!

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:55.910
I thought there were going to be some
guys here with a little fortitude.

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:59.160
I'm not about to stay here and
hang around with you any longer.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.970
As a result of Contestant
Piccolo forfeiting the match,

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:17.220
Contestant Kuririn wins!

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:21.060
Lucky! Bonus, bonus!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:24.520
Contestant Dosukoi narrowly
turns the tables and wins!

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:28.570
The four contestants who will proceed
to the finals have been decided!

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:31.900
Kaio-sama, what's the situation?

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:36.580
Oh, Gohan and the others are winning
their way through smoothly.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:39.040
I suppose they would be, huh?

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:56.090
Good grief, there's no way my pupils
could beat those outrageous guys...

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:02.020
I made it! There's the exit!

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.690
Mister Satan!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:18.120
The dispensary is that way. This
way is the exit to Battle Island.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:22.250
That's fine! My
stomachache is chronic...

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:26.540
It would be best if I had my
personal physician look at me.

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:28.540
B- but what about Mr. Money?

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:31.630
It's all right, it's all
right, I'll be right back.

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:35.930
I'll just dash on over the bridge,
here, and then dash on... dash on...

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:39.010
Huh?

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:44.230
Am I starting to get dizzy, too?

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:50.230
It's gone! It's gone! It's gone!
The bridge is gone!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:58.320
Satan! Satan!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:04.750
For the finals, we're relocating
the arena to Battle Island ll.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:06.500
We're currently underway.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.550
With the battle stage now
on Battle Island ll,

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:14.510
we are just about ready

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:17.090
to hold the finals with these
four powerful competitors,

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:19.140
with a challenge to
Mister Satan at stake!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:32.860
Gohan-chan! Stick it to them!

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.110
This is embarrassing.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:39.360
Trunks! Take me along on
that world hot springs tour!

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:45.250
Kuririn! Hang in there as
reasonably as you can!

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:52.540
And now, I shall
explain the rules.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.630
There are four specially-built
underground tunnels here,

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.190
each one leading to one of the north,
south, east, or west Battle Zones.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:18:59.590
The contestants have drawn lots

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:02.760
to determine who will go ride in the
machines for each tunnel and continue on,

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.100
until they arrive in their
respective Battle Zone.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:08.310
Once they do, there will
be a phenomenal warrior,

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:11.100
here all the way from the North,
South, East, and West Galaxies,

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.870
who has come here
especially to participate

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:15.270
in the Tenkaichi Grand Tournament,
waiting there for them!

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:19.270
The system continues so that
after defeating that warrior,

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.060
whoever gets on the
elevator above them,

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:25.290
and is the first one back here,
at the ground-level center stage,

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:29.710
will be the glorious winner, and
will challenge Mister Satan!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.790
If I can get by without having
to fight Gohan directly,

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:38.170
there's still a good enough
chance left that I could win!

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:42.840
All right, all I have to do is
be the first one back, right?

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:47.560
The final round now starts!
10... 9...

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:49.230
8...

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:50.560
7...

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:52.230
6...

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.560
5...

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:55.110
4...

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:56.570
3...

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.110
2...

00:19:58.190 --> 00:19:59.570
1...

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.900
0!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:16.750
Please enjoy the fight in the
Battle Zone on the monitor screens.

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:31.560
L- I'm going to wet myself!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:21.690
So this is the Battle Zone, huh?

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:34.290
Are you my opponent?!

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:41.880
I've already faced Piccolo today,
and my luck is running strong.

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:46.970
It sure is unlucky for you to
have to fight me like this.

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:53.770
S- she's so cute!

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.730
B- but still,

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:59.310
just because you're a woman, you
won't get any mercy from me!

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:01.770
I'm going to be the
first one back!

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:27.340
W- who are you?!

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:34.680
K- Kuririn!

00:22:42.980 --> 00:22:45.570
<i>Dosukoi'. Dosukoi'.!</i>

00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:48.240
<i>Dosukoi'. Dosukoi'.!</i>

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:53.280
Dosukoi... Dosu... koi...

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:08.800
He killed him!

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:26.570
What's going on here?!

00:23:26.650 --> 00:23:28.570
Dear, this is going too far!

00:23:28.650 --> 00:23:32.450
P- Producer, what is
the meaning of this?!

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:35.330
L- I didn't invite those guys!

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:39.580
The Galactic Warriors I arranged
for were Mister Satan's pupils!

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:41.500
How could they have
switched places so quickly?

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:43.590
Mama!

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:46.500
What?!

00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:16.370
Haven't you got things backward here?!
This is just a game!

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:17.870
We're not out to
kill each other!

00:24:27.960 --> 00:24:29.710
Who are you?!

00:24:34.510 --> 00:24:37.510
Would it be enough if I said I
was just a Galactic Warrior?

00:25:52.510 --> 00:25:55.550
Stop that! This is a
martial arts tournament!

00:25:55.630 --> 00:25:57.970
You're saying this is a game?

00:26:04.640 --> 00:26:06.560
What's going on?

00:26:11.980 --> 00:26:16.200
Mister Satan! Everything
depends on your power now!

00:26:16.280 --> 00:26:18.570
Please help us somehow!
We beg you!

00:26:18.660 --> 00:26:22.240
J-just hang on a second!
My stomach still hurts!

00:26:22.330 --> 00:26:26.580
<i>H' I can buy some time here, then those
other guys should defeat them for me.</i>

00:26:26.660 --> 00:26:28.670
<i>They defeated Cell, after all.</i>

00:26:54.650 --> 00:26:56.690
Are you finished already?

00:27:36.980 --> 00:27:39.030
W- what is this?

00:27:41.990 --> 00:27:43.700
That's an incredible ki!

00:27:48.000 --> 00:27:51.250
Mister Satan! Hurry! Hurry!

00:27:51.330 --> 00:27:55.550
Don't be so impatient!
I'm just wiping now!

00:27:55.630 --> 00:28:03.630
Satan! Satan! Satan! Satan!

00:28:16.320 --> 00:28:18.440
Thank goodness!

00:28:22.320 --> 00:28:24.320
Ladies and gentlemen,
please be at ease!

00:28:24.410 --> 00:28:28.790
Our hero, Mister Satan, is setting
forth to put down these bad guys!

00:28:28.870 --> 00:28:30.660
Everything is all right now!

00:28:30.750 --> 00:28:34.880
Please observe the monitor screens
to see Mister Satan in action!

00:28:39.960 --> 00:28:41.880
H- hurry up and
start this thing!

00:28:41.970 --> 00:28:42.760
Right!

00:28:42.840 --> 00:28:44.930
Wait! I haven't
fastened the seatbelt!

00:28:45.850 --> 00:28:48.180
Earth is in a great pinch.

00:28:49.310 --> 00:28:52.810
Who would have
figured on Bojack?

00:28:52.890 --> 00:28:54.770
BOjack?

00:28:54.850 --> 00:28:58.820
Long ago, he was a thug,
brimming with an evil Ki,

00:28:58.900 --> 00:29:01.060
who wandered the North, South,
East, and West Galaxies,

00:29:01.080 --> 00:29:04.780
attempting to destroy
each one of them.

00:29:04.860 --> 00:29:06.780
You mean someone
like Piccolo Daimao?

00:29:06.870 --> 00:29:08.780
He was a bloodthirsty devil,

00:29:08.870 --> 00:29:11.910
with an evil Ki far greater
than Piccolo Daimao.

00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:15.710
As such, the four of us Kaio, from
the north, south, east, and west,

00:29:15.790 --> 00:29:16.920
put our powers together,

00:29:17.000 --> 00:29:20.760
and sealed him up on a planet
at the far end of the galaxy.

00:29:20.840 --> 00:29:23.000
Sealed him up on a planet at
the far end of the galaxy?

00:29:23.020 --> 00:29:25.430
Goku, this is your fault.

00:29:25.510 --> 00:29:29.850
By wrecking my Kaio World
during the fight with Cell,

00:29:29.930 --> 00:29:33.890
and causing me to die, the
seal has been broken.

00:29:33.980 --> 00:29:37.770
But to think that Bojack would
set his sights on Earth!

00:29:37.860 --> 00:29:41.190
But then, Kaio-sama,
Earth still has Gohan!

00:29:49.330 --> 00:29:51.370
<i>K- Kuririn-san!</i>

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.880
Trunks-san! Kuririn-san!

00:30:02.960 --> 00:30:06.760
Hey, kid, Earth is a
nice planet, huh?

00:30:23.320 --> 00:30:25.900
What an incredible battle power!

00:30:28.320 --> 00:30:30.030
Gohan!

00:30:31.990 --> 00:30:37.000
A- are these the guys who killed
the four Galactic Warriors?

00:30:40.880 --> 00:30:44.880
From now on, this planet
belongs to Bojack-sama.

00:30:48.840 --> 00:30:49.890
Ridiculous!

00:30:49.970 --> 00:30:52.760
You think we're just going
to let you have it your way?

00:30:52.850 --> 00:30:56.230
Bojack-sama is invincible
throughout the galaxy!

00:30:56.310 --> 00:30:58.980
For Earth, the greatest planet
in the Northern Galaxy,

00:30:59.060 --> 00:31:00.900
most beautiful of all...

00:31:00.980 --> 00:31:05.030
he is the most deserving
being to rule over it.

00:31:06.320 --> 00:31:09.780
We will kill anyone
who defies him.

00:31:09.860 --> 00:31:12.910
Don't go downplaying us!

00:31:41.150 --> 00:31:42.560
You'll pay for this!

00:32:38.660 --> 00:32:40.250
Not bad, kid.

00:32:40.330 --> 00:32:43.120
But with that level of fighting
power, you'll never beat us,

00:32:43.210 --> 00:32:45.210
no matter how hard you try!

00:33:06.230 --> 00:33:07.430
This is going to be a problem!

00:33:07.450 --> 00:33:11.420
Gohan! Get angry! Show
them your true power!

00:33:32.300 --> 00:33:34.630
D- damn...

00:33:58.410 --> 00:34:00.030
Piccolo-sen!

00:34:01.660 --> 00:34:05.330
Looks like someone with a bit
of a backbone showed up.

00:34:39.200 --> 00:34:40.620
Damn it!

00:34:44.330 --> 00:34:46.290
Piccolo-sen!

00:34:53.300 --> 00:34:56.670
I'm going to get you back good
for what you did earlier!

00:35:42.640 --> 00:35:44.220
Dad!

00:35:44.310 --> 00:35:46.850
I'll defeat this one!

00:36:04.330 --> 00:36:06.240
Veg eta-san!

00:36:29.310 --> 00:36:31.810
Dad had utterly lost the will
to fight after Goku-san died,

00:36:31.890 --> 00:36:36.900
and yet here he is, helping me and
Gohan-san during this crisis!

00:36:54.210 --> 00:36:56.540
Trunks, you keep out of this!

00:37:06.970 --> 00:37:09.890
Dad, you can't do any
more in your condition!

00:37:09.970 --> 00:37:13.230
L- I thought I told you
to stay out of this!

00:37:13.310 --> 00:37:15.230
Piccolo-sen!

00:37:15.310 --> 00:37:20.480
D- don't concern yourself
with me, defeat that guy!

00:37:20.980 --> 00:37:22.440
Right!

00:37:42.300 --> 00:37:44.340
Damn!

00:37:45.630 --> 00:37:47.510
Veg eta-san!

00:37:49.180 --> 00:37:51.930
You'll have to face me!

00:37:57.730 --> 00:38:00.230
Gohan-chan! Trunks!

00:38:00.320 --> 00:38:03.240
W- wait! I still haven't
fastened my seatbelt!

00:38:03.320 --> 00:38:04.610
Start!

00:38:11.990 --> 00:38:13.450
Take this!

00:38:57.080 --> 00:39:02.750
Our telekinesis gives rise to a
containment zone, binding your power!

00:39:02.840 --> 00:39:07.380
The more you struggle, the
more your power drops!

00:39:15.520 --> 00:39:19.020
Kid, you fought well.
I commend you.

00:39:55.180 --> 00:39:56.890
Satan-san!

00:39:56.970 --> 00:39:59.890
It looks like your life got
extended just a little bit.

00:39:59.980 --> 00:40:02.440
Damn you!

00:40:09.650 --> 00:40:12.860
Kaio-sama, ain't there
anything we can do?!

00:40:35.510 --> 00:40:38.930
Can you see your father
in the Next World yet?

00:40:39.020 --> 00:40:43.020
The two of you will enjoy the show
of carnage that is about to begin.

00:40:43.650 --> 00:40:45.520
Kaio-sama!

00:41:12.630 --> 00:41:15.390
F- Father...

00:41:22.640 --> 00:41:25.440
I can't take it any more!

00:41:25.520 --> 00:41:28.690
Goku! You're dead!

00:41:34.530 --> 00:41:36.490
<i>You ain't going to
get away with this!</i>

00:41:36.990 --> 00:41:38.450
<i>What'?!</i>

00:41:47.670 --> 00:41:52.590
Gohan! Show him your true power!

00:41:55.510 --> 00:41:57.640
Father...

00:41:57.720 --> 00:42:03.140
Stop acting like such a pampered baby!
You have to protect the earth!

00:42:08.650 --> 00:42:10.610
Father!

00:42:21.660 --> 00:42:24.540
W- what was that just now?!

00:42:47.980 --> 00:42:51.480
Father saved me!

00:43:12.000 --> 00:43:16.630
And he said you weren't going
to get away with this!

00:43:19.630 --> 00:43:23.720
He told me to protect the earth!

00:43:58.380 --> 00:44:01.300
Bujin! Bido!

00:45:32.310 --> 00:45:34.940
Dammit!

00:45:58.080 --> 00:46:01.250
D- damn!

00:46:01.340 --> 00:46:05.300
How could a kid like
you do this to me?!

00:46:09.850 --> 00:46:12.770
And then... and then...

00:46:12.850 --> 00:46:15.770
he told me to stop acting
like some pampered baby!

00:47:28.970 --> 00:47:31.220
Gohan, you did fine!

00:47:31.300 --> 00:47:34.850
Goku, you still acted
recklessly, huh?

00:47:35.970 --> 00:47:38.770
Kaio-sama, did I do something?

00:47:38.850 --> 00:47:42.860
Oh, I must have blinked,
so I can't be sure.

00:47:49.860 --> 00:47:53.280
"Satan saves the earth
a 2nd time," huh?

00:47:53.990 --> 00:47:57.330
Just once, I'd like to give
him a good talking-to.

00:47:57.410 --> 00:47:59.910
It's okay, isn't it?

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:03.250
There's no question that he did
help me out there, after all.

00:48:03.330 --> 00:48:07.210
In the end, he defended his title
of "World's Greatest Fool!"

00:48:12.300 --> 00:48:14.220
Father?

00:48:14.300 --> 00:48:16.890
Gohan, all things considered,
you were something else!

00:48:16.970 --> 00:48:18.430
You single-handedly
defeated the guy

00:48:18.520 --> 00:48:21.230
that neither Piccolo nor
Vegeta could stand up to!

00:48:21.310 --> 00:48:23.560
It wasn't single-handed.
Father...

00:48:23.650 --> 00:48:25.230
Goku came back to life?!

00:48:25.320 --> 00:48:27.900
I'm joking! I'm joking!

00:48:27.980 --> 00:48:31.570
Why, you scoundrel!
At a time like this?!

00:48:31.650 --> 00:48:37.120
"At the second Tenkaichi Grand Tournament,
you too can challenge Satan!"

00:48:38.660 --> 00:48:45.250
<i>You're moving on,
beyond the galaxy,</i>

00:48:45.340 --> 00:48:50.050
<i>Toward the land of light,
you're rising high!</i>

00:48:52.630 --> 00:48:59.310
<i>Summer brings its
light with it for us.</i>

00:48:59.390 --> 00:49:04.650
<i>It's new, and yet for
some reason, familiar.</i>

00:49:04.730 --> 00:49:12.730
<i>We feel the strong sunlight
hitting our cheeks,</i>

00:49:13.740 --> 00:49:21.740
<i>And our courage Hows
through us now!</i>

00:49:22.500 --> 00:49:24.620
<i>Let's fly;</i>

00:49:24.710 --> 00:49:32.710
<i>The blue of the brightly shining
sky and sea swims within our eyes!</i>

00:49:36.300 --> 00:49:38.100
<i>Net sky!</i>

00:49:38.180 --> 00:49:46.180
<i>Raising our hands high, up to
the light, we connect with it!</i>

00:49:49.480 --> 00:49:55.990
<i>Some day, our smiles
will reach there, too.</i>

00:49:57.660 --> 00:50:04.250
<i>I'm moving on,
beyond the galaxy,</i>

00:50:04.330 --> 00:50:11.000
<i>Toward the land of light, I'm
rising high, rising high!</i>
